LAMMPS (7 Aug 2019)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# 3D Silicon crack simulation using Stillinger-Weber

#--------------------------------------------- STRING SETUP FOR OUTPUT--------------------------------------------

variable name string data
variable std  string study
variable bdr  string boundary


#---------------------------------------------- ENVOURMENT SETUP---------------------------------------------------

dimension  	3
boundary 	s s p
units 		metal
atom_style 	atomic
neighbor 	0.3 bin
neigh_modify 	delay 5

#-------------------------------------------------------GEOMETRY---------------------------------------------------



lattice		diamond 5.43
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.43 5.43 5.43
region		box block 0 400 0 1000 0 1 units lattice
create_box 	9 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (2172 5430 5.43)
  5 by 16 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 	1 box
Created 3202801 atoms
  create_atoms CPU = 0.041023 secs


mass  		1 28.0855
mass  		2 28.0855
mass  		3 28.0855
mass  		4 28.0855
mass  		5 28.0855
mass  		6 28.0855
mass  		7 28.0855
mass  		8 28.0855
mass  		9 28.0855
#----------------------------------------------POTENTIAL----------------------------------------

pair_style 	sw
pair_coeff 	* * Si.sw Si Si Si Si Si Si Si Si Si

#--------------------------------------------GROUPS AND REGIONS------------------------------------

fix  		1 all nve
run 		0
